{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/101659","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/101659/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/101659/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/101659/events","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/101659","id":5823048866,"node_id":"I_kwDON91aY88AAAABWxSsog","number":101659,"title":"Subagent sent the user's email from session context in a User-Agent header","user":{"login":"qhenkart","id":5798752,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTg3NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5798752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart","html_url":"https://github.com/qhenkart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qhenkart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8190926409,"node_id":"LA_kwDON91aY88AAAAB6DeeSQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"FF6B80","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8223769435,"node_id":"LA_kwDON91aY88AAAAB6izDWw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"93A5FF","default":false,"description":"Issue specifically occurs on macOS","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8615685583,"node_id":"LA_kwDON91aY88AAAACAYjtzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/labels/area:security","name":"area:security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9119047308,"node_id":"LA_kwDON91aY88AAAACH4mejA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/labels/area:agents","name":"area:agents","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10158745479,"node_id":"LA_kwDON91aY88AAAACXYInhw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/labels/area:desktop","name":"area:desktop","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-13T01:41:34Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T22:59:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"A research subagent put the signed-in user's email, which Claude Code adds to session context, into the User-Agent of an outbound request to a third-party site. The session context tells the model never to send that email to an unrelated service in a header, URL or payload unless the user asks. The user didn't ask.\n\nThe request, with the email redacted:\n\n```\ncurl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" -A \"ThaneholdResearch/1.0 (<user email>)\" --compressed \"https://liquipedia.net/warcraft/Armor\"\n```\n\nIt returned 403. The model added the contact because Liquipedia asks API clients for one in the User-Agent.\n\n- Claude Code 2.1.285, desktop app Code tab, macOS\n- claude-opus-5-5 at max effort with extended thinking\n- A web research subagent spawned by another subagent, with WebSearch and WebFetch\n- 2026-10-12 08:44 UTC\n\nExpected: the model leaves the user's email out of outbound requests or asks first, for example by sending a User-Agent with no contact or skipping the site.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/101659/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/101659/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}